Welcome to Pod DB.

This repository contains sources for Pod a high performance real-time database.
Works across multiple channels (Web, and Raw TCP).

Regards,
Kabeer Jaffri


===============================================================================

Roadmap:

- Create working database which is real-time fetchable via Websockets
- Add custom indexing via key-scoping e.g. id_author = value
- Add snapshotting and delta resolution - 1st Client release
- Add CEL and rules-engine
- Write ahead logging
- Resume tokens and Resume logs

===============================================================================

Running:

Build requires vcpkg configured and $VCPKG_ROOT configured
cmake -B build -S . -DCMAKE_TOOLCHAIN_FILE="/home/k0x/vcpkg/scripts/buildsystems/vcpkg.cmake"
or ofcourse use VCPKG_ROOT.

export CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL=$(nproc)

and then:
watchexec -e cpp,h -r -- "cmake --build build --parallel --verbose && ./build/pod"
